<title>USA: Copley Pharmaceutical Inc has Q4 net loss.</title>
<headline>Copley Pharmaceutical Inc has Q4 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.63     loss	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,960     loss	 1,717</p>
<p> Revs			31,214		   36,885</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,099		   10,064</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.66     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net loss		  12,673     loss	 2,543</p>
<p> Revs		     123,461		  142,158</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,081		   18,977</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 results hurt by $12.2 million in recall and litigation related costs, and $3.5 million in restructuring costs. Excluding these charges, net income would have been $0.5 million or $0.03 per share, compared to a loss of $0.8 million or $0.04 for the same 1995 quarter.</p>
</text>
